&lt;div style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/nav%3Aside/styleFrame.html?bhl&quot; name=&quot;typeFrame&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wors-obrine&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4888797&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609360888&quot; alt=&quot;WOrs Obrine&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4888797)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wors-obrine&quot;  &gt;WOrs Obrine&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 27 Mar 2020 05:54:32 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="display:none"><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/nav%3Aside/styleFrame.html?bhl" name="typeFrame"></iframe></div> <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div id="wiki-tabview-12a301d43b36354c6b8e0f2996c5f3af" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>个人资料</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>参与项目</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>留言板</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>成就墙</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>WOrs那些事</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>宿舍的墙</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>当前任务</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/1"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/1/medium.jpg" alt="1" class="image" /></a></p> <p style="text-align: center;">↑WOrs Obrine↑</p> <p><strong>项目编号</strong>：已撤档</p> <p><strong>项目等级：</strong>无效化</p> <p><strong>特殊收容措施</strong>：鉴于目前项目已经以固定常态出现并不再引起事件，已撤销所有相关的收容措施。</p> <p><strong>描述：</strong>项目本质为一种潜在模因，在阅读██之后会显示出对<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1810">AM基金会</a>的忠诚与热情，并拥有不可控的压制休谟指数反应，原因未知。在一次偶然的事故中，平民WOrs Obrine受此影响，在心理医师的努力下，WOrs Obrine不再出现上述反应，但其降低休谟指数的异常无法抵消。此外，项目再没有出现收容失效的情况，已于██撤除档案。</p> <hr /> <p><strong>人员姓名</strong>：WOrs Obrine，又称WOrso，虫草，麦芽汁。</p> <p><strong>中文名</strong>：破阵子。你也可以叫他小羊（？）。</p> <p><strong>人员性别：</strong>男</p> <p><strong>年龄</strong>：15</p> <p><strong>人员描述</strong>：一头的棕色卷发，蓝瞳，以及一副伪装成管家镜的斯克兰顿微型稳定锚。日常以白衬衫出现在人们视野里，偶尔会出现其他服饰。对他人沉默寡言，对熟悉的人口若悬河，心理硬伤（指物理上，心脏先天性畸形）。说话声音很懒，有时喜欢拖尾音，心情不好时攻击性极高，但是一般心态都不会炸。</p> <p>2018年进入基金会，两年间一直任职于Site-CN-09，由于模因原因，其心理年龄未知，但似乎因为身体年龄原因，行事不太方便。体型较小，行动灵活。推测因为模因污染，其思维方式跟不上/超越当前节奏，言语谈吐也会发生跳跃式改变，精神也受其影响而存在问题。</p> <p><strong>爱好</strong>：绘画，游戏，看书（尤其是科幻）</p> <p><strong>厌恶</strong>：你猜啊~</p> <p>无更多信息。</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <div class="infobox"></div> <div class="sortbar {$sortbar}"></div> <div class="translation yes"></div> <div class="collab-header" style="text-align: center;"> <hr /> <h2><span>更多页面</span></h2> <hr /></div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/2"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/2/medium.jpg" alt="2" class="image" /></a></p> <hr /> <p>欢迎留言啦~&#8230;&#8230;..<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wors-obrine" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4888797&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609360888" alt="WOrs Obrine" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4888797)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wors-obrine" >WOrs Obrine</a></span></p> <p>哟！恭喜WOrs！继续努力写完啦咕咕咕咕——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6062512&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609360888" alt="YUANNN" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6062512)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn" >YUANNN</a></span></p> <p>哇！恭喜WOrs！希望09越来越好鸭——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cloud-stomo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4921264&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609360888" alt="Cloud_StoMo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4921264)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cloud-stomo" >Cloud_StoMo</a></span></p> <p>恭喜！<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">迟来的祝贺</span> ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4400843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609360888" alt="Ora_Spring" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4400843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" >Ora_Spring</a></span></p> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">靠，太厉害了。</span>恭喜！相信09必定会越来越好。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vastrode" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6251754&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609360888" alt="Vastrode" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6251754)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vastrode" >Vastrode</a></span></p> <p>啊哈，留个言纪念一下，愿共勉——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mystrs-my" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5661001&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609360888" alt="Mystrs-MY" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5661001)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mystrs-my" >Mystrs-MY</a></span></p> <p>仰慕一下。<span style="color: white">那什么……前辈……其实那篇文章我又重写了一遍的……所以你相当于其实还没有看过……[]</span>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djpieplus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6603529&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609360888" alt="djpieplus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6603529)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djpieplus" >djpieplus</a></span></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/%E8%88%9E"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/%E8%88%9E/medium.jpg" alt="舞" class="image" /></a></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong><em>2020嫁之竞赛</em></strong></p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/1810"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/1810/medium.jpg" alt="1810" class="image" /></a></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong><em>2020画廊大赛</em></strong></p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/%E8%8A%B1"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/%E8%8A%B1/medium.jpg" alt="花" class="image" /></a></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong><em>第一篇外围</em></strong></p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/1809"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/1809/medium.jpg" alt="1809" class="image" /></a></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong><em>处女作</em></strong></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/%E6%8A%84%E8%A2%AD"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/%E6%8A%84%E8%A2%AD/medium.jpg" alt="抄袭" class="image" /></a></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong><em>被误的文章</em></strong></p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8/medium.jpg" alt="作用" class="image" /></a></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong><em>被误的作用</em></strong></p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/%E6%80%A7%E5%88%AB"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/%E6%80%A7%E5%88%AB/medium.jpg" alt="性别" class="image" /></a></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong><em>被误的性别</em></strong></p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%BA%BF"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%BA%BF/medium.jpg" alt="时间线" class="image" /></a></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong><em>学术讲座？</em></strong></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-5" style="display:none"> <div style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/%E7%89%99"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/%E7%89%99/medium.jpg" alt="牙" class="image" /></a> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">感谢Morphie！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/Morphie"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/Morphie/medium.jpg" alt="Morphie" class="image" /></a><br /> <strong>非常感谢<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/morphie" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5001379&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609360888" alt="Morphie" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5001379)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/morphie" >Morphie</a></span>！</strong></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">如果你看见WOrs没有戴他的管家镜</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86/medium.jpg" alt="记忆" class="image" /></a><br /> 记得提醒他一下</div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">嗯？WOrs的本体？</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/%E5%85%A8%E8%BA%AB"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/%E5%85%A8%E8%BA%AB/medium.jpg" alt="全身" class="image" /></a><br /> 还行？</div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;感谢雨树！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;点我隐藏</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/worsssss/%E9%9B%A8%E6%A0%91%E7%BB%98"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/worsssss/%E9%9B%A8%E6%A0%91%E7%BB%98/medium.jpg" alt="雨树绘" class="image" /></a><br /> <strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raintree" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5375092&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609360888" alt="RainTree" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5375092)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raintree" >RainTree</a></span>绘制！</strong></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;感谢艺兮！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;点我隐藏