						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><span style="color: transparent">隐藏/删除了一些不太满意的作品，隐藏了的…大概是打算重画？</span><br /> ▶又菜又懒，如有不足请多指教。<br /> ▶有学习<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1621343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609360890" alt="SunnyClockwork" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1621343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" >SunnyClockwork</a></span>(神)的元素，只能算拙劣的模仿。<br /> ▶二设不喜轻喷。<br /> ▶喜欢按着印象画，所以与原文不符的成分可能会较多x<br /> ▶待补充</p> <table style="margin:0; padding:0"> <tr> <td style="margin:0; padding:0"> <div id="toc"> <div id="toc-action-bar"><a href="javascript:;" >折叠</a><a style="display: none" href="javascript:;" >展开</a></div> <div class="title">目录</div> <div id="toc-list"> <div style="margin-left: 1em;"><a href="#toc0">项目相关</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc1">SCP-004 穿越锈钥之门</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc2">SCP-1983 死境之门</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc3">SCP-231 特殊个人需求</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc4">SCP-2317 异界之门</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc5">SCP-001 守门者</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc6">SCP-3999 我于万物之中</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc7">SCP-3000 阿难陀舍沙</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc8">SCP-239 巫魔幼女</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc9">SCP-020 隐形霉菌</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc10">SCP-1027 肉食性神经中枢</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc11">SCP-4231 蒙托克之屋</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc12">SCP-682 不灭孽蜥</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc13">SCP-3001 红现实</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc14">SCP-2845 牡鹿</a></div> <div style="margin-left: 2em;"><a href="#toc15">SCP-