&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4&quot; align=&quot;&quot; frameborder=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot; scrolling=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;close-credits&quot; style=&quot;height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;桃色狂想曲&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;作者：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timeelapsed&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3662783&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609360894&quot; alt=&quot;TimeElapsed&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3662783)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timeelapsed&quot;  &gt;TimeElapsed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;有时候写出来的东西未必要有什么意义。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;图自己画的，CC-BY-SA 3.0。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;感谢&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/diorite&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4107059&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609360894&quot; alt=&quot;Diorite&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4107059)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/diorite&quot;  &gt;Diorite&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;与&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/df-thirteen&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4011450&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609360894&quot; alt=&quot;DF-thirteen&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4011450)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/df-thirteen&quot;  &gt;DF-thirteen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;的友情出演。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
